{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20548","headline":"送郑尚书赴广州 · 张籍","name":"送郑尚书赴广州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣朝选将持符节，内使宣时百辟听。\n海北蛮夷来舞蹈，岭南封管送图经。\n白鹇飞遶迎官舫，红槿开当讌客亭。\n此处莫言多瘴疠，天边看取老人星。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}